  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening the Capacity for Non-communicable Disease (NCD) Prevention &amp; Management Based on Primary Health Care in El Salvador</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for equipment and training initiatives aimed at strengthening the capacity of healthcare personnel in three areas. Healthcare Digital Competencies: Strengthening digital capabilities in areas such as digital health innovation, data management, and cybersecurity. Public Health Crisis Response Competencies: Enhancing crisis response capabilities by establishing epidemiological surveillance systems and updating relevant health guidelines and regulations. Ophthalmic Care Competencies: Improving the ophthalmic treatment system and strengthening services.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Utilizing the National Training Center of the Ministry of Health to implement capacity-building programs for healthcare personnel with the aim of improving healthcare services.&#xc5d8;&#xc0b4;&#xbc14;&#xb3c4;&#xb974; &#xb0b4; &#xace0;&#xd608;&#xc555; &#xbc0f; &#xb2f9;&#xb1e8; &#xb4f1; &#xb9cc;&#xc131;&#xc9c8;&#xd658;&#xc5d0; &#xb300;&#xd55c; &#xad00;&#xb9ac;&#xc5ed;&#xb7c9; &#xac15;&#xd654;, &#xc790;&#xad81;&#xacbd;&#xbd80;&#xc554; &#xc870;&#xae30;&#xc9c4;&#xb2e8; &#xbc0f; &#xcd94;&#xc801;&#xad00;&#xb9ac; &#xc5ed;&#xb7c9; &#xac15;&#xd654;</narrative>
  </description>
